
•	Visual Effects: When a monster is defeated, sparkles appear, followed by the appearance of a heart as a reward.
Score Mechanics:
	•	Collect Rewards: Hearts and other rewards are collected after defeating monsters, increasing the player’s score.

Angel Messages (Pop-Up Screens):
	•	Guidance Angels: Occasionally, angel pop-up screens appear.
	•	Messages: These angels deliver encouraging messages, guidance, or short wisdom moments to the player during gameplay.